pond to crimes, and engage in intense high-speed chases reaching nearly 200 MPH.\n\nTake on criminal cases, escort VIPs, transport valuable cargo, and pursue suspects across highways, city streets, and rural roads. You’re free to follow structured missions or explore the open world and respond to crimes as they happen.\n\nStory-Driven Cases and Free-Roam Gameplay\n\nThe game features 5 major criminal cases, each made up of multiple missions that can be tackled in different ways. In addition to case missions, Crash Time 2 offers free-roam police gameplay with bonus assignments, hidden objectives, and optional mini-games scattered throughout the map.\n\nWith over 40 tracks and locations, the world encourages exploration while rewarding skilled driving and fast decision-making.\n\nArcade Racing with Police Action\n\nCrash Time 2 focuses on accessible arcade handling combined with action-oriented police mechanics. Choose from over 20 AI-driven vehicles, each featuring a visual damage system that reacts to collisions and crashes. Three difficulty settings allow both casual players and racing veterans to tailor the experience to their playstyle.\n\nKey Features\n\n• \nOpen-world arcade racing with police-themed gameplay\n\n• \nPlay as an Autobahn police officer in high-speed pursuits\n\n• \n5 criminal cases with multiple missions each\n\n• \nFree-roam mode with dynamic crimes and bonus objectives\n\n• \nOver 40 tracks and locations to explore\n\n• \nVehicles reaching speeds close to 200 MPH\n\n• \nVisual damage system for AI vehicles\n\n• \n3 difficulty levels for customizable challenge\n\n• \nHidden tasks and mini-games throughout the world","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/11390/header.jpg?t=1766083150"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steam